,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一間特色日式拉麵餐廳\n\n餐點：醬油牛肝菌清湯、叉燒飯\n\n特點：\n\n1. 餐點美味\n\n醬油牛肝菌清湯\n（麵條軟硬適中、湯頭濃郁不死鹹、叉燒軟嫩細緻）\n\n叉燒飯\n（飯體Q彈不軟爛、飯內搭配的煙燻肉丁鹹香、美奶滋的量剛好，整體吃起來不會很油膩）\n\n2. 店內明亮，座位舒適\n（位置的間隔剛好不會太擠）\n\n3. 座位上有置物空間\n\n4. 餐點性價比中間偏高\n（以拉麵的口味和份量）\n\n5. 用餐環境乾淨\n\n6. 交通方便（靠近捷運西門站）\n\n缺點：\n\n1. 店內用餐熱門時段生意興隆\n\n2. 餐點湯頭偏油（醬油牛肝菌清湯）",null,[0,26]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXUm1ONlJuQk9SbFpKVjFWck5GSnJSazVVVlRGUldUQTVUbFZ0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1047,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWRmN6RnBORlZJV1VrNFJrRk5UVTFRWTA5TlVtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2376fd295f346a34!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkVFczFpNFVIWUk4RkFNTU1QY09NUmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWRmN6RnBORlZJV1VrNFJrRk5UVTFRWTA5TlVtYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWRmN6RnBORlZJV1VrNFJrRk5UVTFRWTA5TlVtYxI-Ci9